    {
      "id": "critical_question",
      "topic": "limitations",
      "basis": "interpretation",
      "text": "归一的completed是否可靠？OpenCode/Pi的usesResultEvent=false使exit0且无timeout即可完成，error事件仅记账；首JSON后直接await handle.result，allowedWaitSeconds不是全程硬截止。POSIX取消仅杀直接子进程，末尾无换行stdout没有flush。默认bypass_permissions并自动失败换模型时，任务副作用可能重复。",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "2026-10-21-07-github-1425006726-root-source"
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        {
          "plugin_id": "github:1425006726:root",
